do mundo.

508
00:45:06,542 --> 00:45:08,127
Ah, Antonio,

509
00:45:08,211 --> 00:45:10,171
Antonio, Antonio."

510
00:45:12,548 --> 00:45:15,385
O seu bem amado morre.

511
00:45:15,468 --> 00:45:17,345
Vem?

512
00:45:17,387 --> 00:45:19,430
E assim ela chama o sol

513
